#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.case_when.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.case\\_when"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.where.case_when:1 of
msgid "Replace values where conditions are True, evaluated in order."
msgstr "按顺序替换条件为 True 的值。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.where.case_when:3 of
msgid ""
"Mirrors ``pandas.Series.case_when``: each ``(cond, replacement)`` pair is"
" evaluated sequentially; the first condition that is True determines the "
"replacement value for that row.  Rows where no condition is True keep "
"their original value."
msgstr ""
"镜像 ``pandas.Series.case_when``：每个 ``(cond, replacement)`` 对按顺序"
"求值；第一个为 True 的条件确定该行的 替换值。没有任何条件为 True 的行保留"
"其原始值。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.where.case_when:8 of
msgid ""
"Both *cond* and *replacement* may be callables; when callable they are "
"invoked with *lf* and should return a LiteFrame (for *cond*) or a "
"LiteFrame / scalar (for *replacement*), matching the pandas contract "
"where callables are computed on the Series itself."
msgstr ""
"*cond* 和 *replacement* 都可能是可调用对象；当为可调用对象时，它们使用 *"
"lf* 调用并应返回一个 LiteFrame（对于 *cond*）或一个 LiteFrame/标量（对于 "
"*replacement*），符合 pandas 中可调用对象在 Series 本身上计算的约定。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.where.case_when of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.where.case_when:13 of
msgid ""
"Ordered list of ``(condition, replacement)`` pairs.  *condition* is a "
"boolean LiteFrame, or a callable returning one.  *replacement* is a "
"scalar, a LiteFrame, or a callable returning either."
msgstr ""
"``(condition, replacement)`` 对的有序列表。*condition* 是一个布尔型 "
"LiteFrame，或返回一个布尔型 LiteFrame 的 可调用对象。*replacement* 是一个"
"标量、LiteFrame，或返回其中任一类型的可调用对象。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.where.case_when of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.where.case_when:18 of
msgid "A LiteFrame with the same columns as *lf*."
msgstr "具有与 *lf* 相同列的 LiteFrame。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.where.case_when of
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.where.case_when:23 of
msgid ":py:obj:`where`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.where.case_when:24 of
msgid "Replace values where a condition is False."
msgstr "替换条件为 False 的值。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.where.case_when:26 of
msgid ":py:obj:`mask`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.where.case_when:27 of
msgid "Replace values where a condition is True."
msgstr "替换条件为 True 的值。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.where.case_when:30 of
msgid "示例"
msgstr ""

